msgid "SERIAL8 -> UART8 (MAVLink2, connected to on board BlueTooth module)"
msgstr "SERIAL8 -> UART8（MAVLink2，连接至板载蓝牙模块）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743v2.rst:56
#: eebdcafbd0ad4d41acb9d0c88b8157b3
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743v2.rst:57
#: 67b26a3bf36347dbb79835c9bd11d532
msgid ""
"The UART6  is compatible with all ArduPilot supported receiver protocols."
msgstr "UART6 兼容所有 ArduPilot 支持的接收机协议。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743v2.rst:59
#: cb54cba6541a4c19b1b9f9e827eca44c
msgid "PPM is not supported."
msgstr "不支持 PPM。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743v2.rst:60
#: cc6487dbdaf34b61ae3c7c2cb3938e9b
msgid "SBUS/DSM/SRXL connects to the RX6 pin."
msgstr "SBUS/DSM/SRXL 连接至 RX6 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743v2.rst:61
#: d4d6553c68324a80a9b0eca9396fc961
msgid "FPort requires connection to TX6 . See FPort Receivers."
msgstr "FPort 需连接至 TX6。请参阅 FPort 接收机文档。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743v2.rst:62
#: 1f89f4a857414baba3a83f6589e7a1f2
msgid ""
"CRSF also requires a TX6 connection, in addition to RX6, and automatically "
"provides telemetry."
msgstr "CRSF 除 RX6 外还需连接 TX6，并自动提供数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743v2.rst:63
#: 7a869439adba45c3bcbc34730042a8e7
msgid ""
"SRXL2 requires a connection to TX6 and automatically provides telemetry. Set"
" :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` to “4”."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2 需连接 TX6 并自动提供数传。请将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 设为「4」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743v2.rst:65
#: 071f861e982549a3823787e2e0258bdf
msgid ""
"Any UART can also be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`Radio Control Systems "
"<common-rc-systems>` for details."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 中任何 UART 也可用于 RC 系统连接，与除 PPM 外的所有协议兼容。详情请参阅 :ref:`遥控系统 <common-rc-"
"systems>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743v2.rst:68
#: 2b1098bc0ee646fd96a7d0216fb6fa91
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743v2.rst:69
#: ecee0c97e00e44dba3db4676af1c081d
msgid ""
"The MicoAir743v2 supports onboard OSD using OSD_TYPE 1 (MAX7456 driver). "
"Simultaneously, DisplayPort OSD is available on the HD VTX connector, set "
"OSD_TYPE2 = \"5\"."
msgstr ""
"MicoAir743v2 支持使用 OSD_TYPE 1（MAX7456 驱动）的板载 OSD。同时，DisplayPort OSD "
"可通过高清图传接头使用，设置 OSD_TYPE2 = 「5」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743v2.rst:72
#: 1f2284fc34c34fe483153c08dedd63b7
msgid "VTX Support"
msgstr "图传支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743v2.rst:73
#: e4e4bfbdcc9f48eaa7e3cea4c90fe91f
msgid ""
"The SH1.0-6P connector supports a DJI Air Unit / HD VTX connection. Protocol"
" defaults to DisplayPort. Pin 1 of the connector is 9v so be careful not to "
"connect this to a peripheral requiring 5v."
msgstr ""
"SH1.0-6P 接头支持 DJI Air Unit/高清图传连接。协议默认为 DisplayPort。接头的第 1 针为 9V，请勿将其连接到需要 "
"5V 的外设。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743v2.rst:76
#: e6756fdc93f64f94af2dd91ef71aa196
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743v2.rst:77
#: 319a8b5a15264cd38336175ce3881632
msgid ""
"The MicoAir743v2 supports up to 11 PWM outputs. All the channels support "
"DShot. Channels 1-8 support bi-directional DShot."
msgstr "MicoAir743v2 最多支持 11 路 PWM 输出。所有通道均支持 DShot，通道 1-8 支持双向 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743v2.rst:79
#: c8c1129c68324134841f7ab5e50746cf
msgid ""
"PWM outputs are grouped and every group must use the same output protocol:"
msgstr "PWM 输出按组划分，每组必须使用相同的输出协议："

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743v2.rst:81
#: ad8eed2a30e849598f271519849f8a44
msgid "1, 2, 3, 4 are Group 1"
msgstr "1、2、3、4 属于第 1 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743v2.rst:82
#: f501ae12c98d4564a5e567597c610c7e
msgid "5, 6 are Group 2"
msgstr "5、6 属于第 2 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743v2.rst:83
#: 7401a35808004830918b6788885bd24c
msgid "7, 8, 11 are Group 3"
msgstr "7、8、11 属于第 3 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743v2.rst:84
#: f26eeff4cc974946a42b701898095404
msgid "9, 10 are Group 4"
msgstr "9、10 属于第 4 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743v2.rst:86
#: ed560edcf92b44da95062a8f95eb7717
msgid ""
"Note: PWM11 is the \"LED\" pin. If this is configured for serial LED use "
"then PWM 7 and 8 can only be used as serial LED also."
msgstr "注意：PWM11 为「LED」引脚。如果将其配置为串行 LED 使用，则 PWM 7 和 8 也只能用作串行 LED。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743v2.rst:89
#: b41d5d8f4de347b6bd21951c67fa8a30
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr "电池监测"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743v2.rst:90
#: b73b2b90fad14b5593cbd7363c76fa3e
msgid ""
"The board has a internal voltage sensor and connections on the ESC connector"
" for an external current sensor input. The voltage sensor can handle up to "
"6S LiPo batteries."
msgstr "该飞控板内置电压传感器，ESC 接头上有外部电流传感器输入接口。电压传感器支持最高 6S 锂电池。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743v2.rst:93
#: b156c02efa6a43eba9fb66c2fc01c98f
msgid "The default battery parameters are:"
msgstr "默认电池参数为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743v2.rst:95
#: 4ae8cdce1c314881b1f02676d5e2a3db
msgid ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` = 4"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` = 4"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743v2.rst:96
#: 8ccebf63bbb441818e5c0b01a9726e94
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 10"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 10"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743v2.rst:97
#: 5b9c72a6d3084b5494a69bb4e17a8abb
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 21.12"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 21.12"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743v2.rst:98
#: 32b57353df0645b8868ab90c518c2328
msgid ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743v2.rst:99
#: e252a89a8d5a413a94d09bf5ce80bdf3
msgid ":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 40.2"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 40.2"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743v2.rst:102
#: c93b972e555a4d5d883a7b7bb44b7715
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743v2.rst:103
#: 5d32ccec27b7410d9f2958535aec4510
msgid ""
"The MicoAir743v2 has a built-in compass. Due to potential interference, the "
"autopilot is usually used with an external I2C compass as part of a "
"GPS/Compass combination and the internal compass disabled."
msgstr ""
"MicoAir743v2 内置罗盘。由于潜在的干扰问题，飞控通常搭配外置 I2C 罗盘（作为 GPS/罗盘组合的一部分）使用，并禁用内置罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743v2.rst:106
#: 699d8292befa4630a1bced38da8173f6
msgid "BlueTooth"
msgstr "蓝牙"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743v2.rst:107
#: 02cd150c6dc947b38c8769fac8647268
msgid ""
"The MicoAir743v2 has an on board BlueTooth module connected to "
"UART8(SERIAL8). The BlueTooth id is MicoAir743v2-xxxxxx and you can connect "
"to it without pairing id."
msgstr ""
"MicoAir743v2 板载蓝牙模块连接至 UART8（SERIAL8）。蓝牙 ID 为 MicoAir743v2-xxxxxx，无需配对码即可连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743v2.rst:110
#: ba054f1f4dc34f7eae716ec7a9120f58
msgid "Firmware"
msgstr "固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743v2.rst:112
#: cbacbe64060b4e339c37fc1de6a4da7d
msgid ""
"Firmware for this board can be found `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ in sub-folders labeled “MicoAir743v2”"
msgstr ""
"该飞控板的固件可在 `此处 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ 的「MicoAir743v2」子文件夹中找到"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743v2.rst:115
#: c8ca6328d167477d9b447468a70d6025
msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr "加载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743v2.rst:116
#: d45d59a2f5904f5a93251d69c55a7d38
msgid ""
"Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the "
"bootloader button pressed. Then you should load the \"arduXXXX_with_bl.hex\""
" firmware, using your favorite DFU loading tool."
msgstr ""
"首次固件加载可在按住引导程序按钮插入 USB 时通过 DFU 完成。然后使用您喜欢的 DFU "
"烧写工具加载「arduXXXX_with_bl.hex」固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743v2.rst:118
#: 512df3f3ab2e4ed4b05e8ee8b6eb35b0
msgid ""
"Once the initial firmware is loaded you can update the firmware using any "
"ArduPilot ground station software. Updates should be done with the "
"\"\\*.apj\" firmware files."
msgstr "初始固件加载完成后，可使用任何 ArduPilot 地面站软件更新固件。更新应使用「\\*.apj」固件文件。"
